@startuml
title UC-OL-002 接单派发公众号排版 — 分析序列图
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
actor "运营部部长" as A
boundary "接口:部长接口" as B
control "控制:接单派发公众号排版控制" as C
participant "M:成员" as M
participant "L:公众号排版任务" as L
participant "RA:审核岗位安排" as RA
participant "N:成员" as N
A -> B: 接单派发公众号排版(业务信息)
activate B
B -> C: 接单派发公众号排版(业务信息)
activate C
C -> M: 验证业务资格(操作人、部门与职责)
M --> C: 资格结论
break 无权执行
  C --> B: 拒绝结果及原因
  B --> A: 拒绝结果及原因
end

C -> L: 接单派发(排版干事、一审、二审)
activate L
L -> RA: 核验审核资格(两岗人员)
RA --> L: 岗位资格
L -> N: 验证归属(运营部排版干事)
N --> L: 成员资格
L --> C: 派发结果
deactivate L

C --> B: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate C
B --> A: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate B
@enduml
